<title>UK: HSBC Asset Management names emerging markets CIO.</title>
<headline>HSBC Asset Management names emerging markets CIO.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>HSBC Asset Management said on Monday it had appointed Stella Yiu as its global emerging markets chief investment officer based in New York.</p>
<p>Yiu is currently a senior fund manager and director with HSBC in Hong Kong.</p>
<p>HSBC Asset Management is the global investment advisory and money management business of HSBC Holdings plc.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +171 542 5887</p>
